  "heading": "Escape from custody",
  "chapter": null,
  "order": 75,
  "text": "Every person subject to naval law who being in lawful custody escapes or attempts to escape from such custody shall be punished with imprisonment for a term which may extend to five years or such other punishment as is hereinafter mentioned.",
